    "detailed_description": "This is a short experience for those interested in budgie genetics. Breed budgies to discover new colours. Patterns of inheritance are based on real-world genetics (recessive, dominant, co-dominant, etc).<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover over 20 realistic colour mutations.<br><br></li><li>Unlock in-game achievements for breeding certain combinations. <br><br></li><li>Watch your birds grow from egg to fledglings. <br><br></li><li>Beware of the effects of inbreeding, which can reduce the number of eggs.<br><br></li><li>Budgies can only breed a few times, so plan your pairings carefully.</li></ul>",
